{"format":"edopsys-canonical-source-bundle-v1","files":[{"path":"EVENT-HASH-CONTRACT.md","sha256":"122ab1c83650b40f74749a868e428f0d6b451b1e7864fea3f2aa65f26ea4d9a2","content":"# Event Hash Contract v1.0.0\n\nThe frozen A/B DomainEvent envelope is not modified.\n\n## Self hash\nThe self-hash payload consists of every DomainEvent field except `event_hash`. Undefined object properties are omitted, object keys are recursively sorted lexicographically, array order is retained, and non-finite numbers are rejected.\n\n`event_hash = sha256(canonical_json(self_hash_payload))`\n\n## Chain hash\nChain metadata is maintained outside DomainEvent to preserve schema compatibility.\n\nFor event N:\n\n- `ordinal = N`\n- `event_hash = DomainEvent.event_hash`\n- `previous_chain_hash = chain_hash(N-1)` or null for N=1\n- `correlation_id = DomainEvent.correlation_id`\n\n`chain_hash(N) = sha256(canonical_json({ordinal,event_id,event_hash,previous_chain_hash,correlation_id}))`\n\nDeletion, substitution, event mutation, or reordering invalidates chain verification.\n"},{"path":"README.md","sha256":"87eb0a62bb6740da0e1c9c84ae12c22197185ff365cd9f18f9bbdc29658ae779","content":"# BUILD-CLP-001-C — Golden Case + Certification Replay Harness\n\nConsumes BUILD-CLP-001-B v1.0.0 and instantiates exactly one synthetic Apple Valley / Whitney Grove-modeled CLP-001 case.\n\n## Scope\n- One golden event stream from `ResidentIssueReported` through `CaseClosed`\n- Append-only in-memory governance repository\n- Canonical DomainEvent self-hashing\n- Separate chained-event ledger to detect deletion/reordering without changing the frozen DomainEvent schema\n- Correlation-only historical replay with pinned authority/policy/worker/task/verification versions\n- Machine-verifiable `CLP001Certification`\n- Fail-closed certification issuance requiring every frozen AT-001..030 and ADV-001..007 result to PASS\n\n## Frozen hash contract\n1. Canonicalization recursively sorts object keys; array order is preserved.\n2. `event_hash = SHA256(canonical_json(DomainEvent excluding event_hash))`.\n3. Chain record is separate from DomainEvent:\n   `{ordinal,event_id,event_hash,previous_chain_hash,chain_hash}`.\n4. `chain_hash = SHA256(canonical_json({ordinal,event_id,event_hash,previous_chain_hash,correlation_id}))`.\n5. The last chain hash is the event-chain root.\n6. Replay hash covers reconstructed historical replay output using pinned version references.\n\n## Known governance boundary\n`AUTH-APPLEVALLEY-PLUMBING@CLP-FIXTURE-1` remains a CLP proof fixture and is explicitly marked `PLACEHOLDER_REQUIRES_OFFICIAL_PINNING`. It is not a production legal-authority package.\n\n## Commit binding\nThe generated certification has `implementation_commit=null` and status `CERTIFIED_WITH_PENDING_COMMIT_BINDING` until the exact source tree is committed to the target repository and re-certified against that SHA.\n"},{"path":"fixtures/golden-case.json","sha256":"d4b35f70590b3e2399052c82cf288a972f3ae5540f2f218d368cdee5cf627421","content":"{\n  \"correlation_id\": \"corr_CLP001_GOLDEN_001\",\n  \"aggregate_id\": \"CASE-CLP-001-GOLDEN-001\",\n  \"final_state\": \"CLOSED\",\n  \"events\": [\n    {\n      \"event_id\": \"evt_CLP001_001\",\n      \"event_type\": \"ResidentIssueReported\",\n      \"occurred_at\": \"2026-10-03T22:01:00.000Z\",\n      \"actor_id\": \"RESIDENT-CLP-001\",\n      \"actor_type\": \"RESIDENT\",\n      \"aggregate_id\": \"CASE-CLP-001-GOLDEN-001\",\n      \"aggregate_version\": 1,\n      \"causation_event_id\": null,\n      \"correlation_id\": \"corr_CLP001_GOLDEN_001\",\n      \"input_refs\": [],\n      \"output_refs\": [],\n      \"source_refs\": [],\n      \"policy_refs\": [],\n      \"evidence_refs\": [\n        \"ev_RESIDENT_STATEMENT\",\n        \"ev_RESIDENT_PHOTO\"\n      ],\n      \"decision\": null,\n      \"reason_code\": null,\n      \"event_hash\": \"sha256:64da0baf9d10f9eb0206e95a96c63f3fce0d235c4e999c8acc67f8b95466cc14\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"event_id\": \"evt_CLP